{
  "table_id": "Table_S02",
  "display_number": "S2",
  "title": "Supplementary Table S2. Instrumental variable estimation of the association of EVI and O₃ with BAA.",
  "panel": "",
  "panel_title": "",
  "notes_before": [],
  "notes_after": [
    "Note. Coefficients represent instrumental variable estimates for the associations of log-transformed EVI and O₃ exposure with BAA. Single-exposure models evaluated each exposure separately, whereas dual-exposure models included EVI and O₃ simultaneously. The EVI instrument was the squared proportion of steep-slope areas, and the O₃ instrument was inversion frequency; both instruments were measured with a 5-year lag relative to the survey wave."
  ],
